### List with filter, sort and pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books?keyword=mongo&sort=-price&page=1&limit=3

### Price range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books?minPrice=300000&maxPrice=500000

### Aggregation statistics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/stats

### One book
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/660000000000000000000024

### One book joined with its author and category
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/660000000000000000000024/full

### Create
POST http://localhost:3000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Refactoring", "isbn": "9780134757599", "price": 540000, "quantity": 4, "publishedYear": 2018, "tags": ["refactoring"], "inStock": true }

### Invalid ObjectId -> 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/abc123
